# Professional Face-Breaker: "Whenever one or more creatures you control deal combat damage to a player, create a Treasure
# token." (CR 510.2, 603.2c). On turn 3 Face-Breaker (2/3, menace) and a Memnite attack Bot2 together, so the batch is one
# player damaged and the trigger makes exactly one Treasure, not one per creature; Bot2 takes 3 (17). Menace is on the
# creature from the moment it enters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Professional Face-Breaker
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Memnite
Island
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Professional Face-Breaker.Cast(Spend: R, R, B)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
? Bot1.Battlefield.Professional Face-Breaker.Keywords = Menace
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Attack(Professional Face-Breaker > Bot2; Memnite > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 6
Bot1.Battlefield.Treasure Token.Token = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Treasure Token.Tapped = false
